      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs text-brand-muted">
        <div class="p-3.5 bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl shadow-sm">
          <strong class="text-brand-dark block mb-1">检查 1 · 是否支持先开月付测试？</strong>
          若只能年付且不允许月付，且品牌开业不足 2 年，建议果断放弃。
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl shadow-sm">
          <strong class="text-brand-dark block mb-1">检查 2 · 是否提供真实内网专线？</strong>
          确认套餐中是否包含 IEPL/IPLC 物理专线节点，还是仅有廉价公网中转。
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl shadow-sm">
          <strong class="text-brand-dark block mb-1">检查 3 · 是否有未用完流量结转机制？</strong>
          按月重置套餐流量过期清零，确认自己是否有足够消耗量。
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl shadow-sm">
          <strong class="text-brand-dark block mb-1">检查 4 · 支付通道手续费是否额外收取？</strong>
          部分境外收银台会在结算时加收 3%–5% 的支付手续费，结算时看清最终实付总额。
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 13: FAQS -->
    <section id="sec-faqs" class="scroll-mt-20">
      <FAQ items={faqItems} title="机场价格、资费与套餐常见疑难问答 (FAQ)" />
    </section>

    <!-- Interactive Tools Callout -->
    <section class="my-10 bg-brand-light p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-border space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-brand-dark">💰 真实成本折算器与智能套餐对比</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted">输入年付总价与月配额，一键换算单月折算价与每 GB 真实单价</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs">
        <a href="/tools/cost-calculator/" class="p-3 bg-white border border-brand-border hover:border-brand-teal rounded-xl shadow-sm text-center font-bold text-brand-dark hover:text-brand-teal transition">
          💰 真实成本折算器
        </a>
        <a href="/tools/plan-finder/" class="p-3 bg-white border border-brand-border hover:border-brand-teal rounded-xl shadow-sm text-center font-bold text-brand-dark hover:text-brand-teal transition">
          🔍 智能套餐筛选器
        </a>
        <a href="/recommend/" class="p-3 bg-white border border-brand-border hover:border-brand-teal rounded-xl shadow-sm text-center font-bold text-brand-dark hover:text-brand-teal transition">
          🏆 查看综合推荐榜
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
